{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some trails should remain untouched.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new episode of the <i>Tales Beyond The Tomb</i> series \u2014 colder, more isolated, and more disturbing than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events that were never fully explained, this chapter takes the player to a remote mountain range haunted by wind, ice, and secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a suffocating atmosphere, immersive audio design, and moments of pure psychological horror, this is a journey back to a place that was never meant to be rediscovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important:</strong> This is a slow-paced walking simulator with a narrative focus. <i>White Silence</i> is about atmosphere, immersion, and discovery at your own pace. It\u2019s for players who enjoy exploring, observing, and piecing the story together through the environment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.poster.avif?t=1753938325\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.webm?t=1753938325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/d572943d05c1b16e7d84921f50500e23.mp4?t=1753938325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Episode 4: White Silence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, a group of young explorers vanished during an expedition into a remote and frozen mountain region. Weeks later, their bodies were found scattered across the terrain \u2014 barefoot, wounded, and frozen in expressions of sheer terror. The case was quickly closed. No answers. No survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you play as a determined investigator, returning to the scene in search of the truth. Accompanied only by a local guide, you must retrace the steps of the doomed expedition, confronting the freezing cold, growing isolation, and the eerie feeling that something \u2014 or someone \u2014 still lingers in those mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to the truth.<br>But some truths should never be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.poster.avif?t=1753938325\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.webm?t=1753938325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.mp4?t=1753938325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic \u2013</strong> Go back in time with visuals inspired by classic horror films from the 80s and 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic Graphics and Immersive Environments -</strong> Feel the terror with realistic visuals and terrifying environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration -\u00a0</strong>Discover tapes, documents, and remnants of the original expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End -\u00a0</strong>An ambiguous, disturbing ending \u2014 just like the case it's inspired by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Text System \u2013</strong> Immerse yourself in the story with dynamic, narrative dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold and Insanity -</strong> Sometimes the freezing winds of the mountains can cause some disturbances and hallucinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically an immersive first-person walking simulator with an engaging story. Investigate and explore a cold and inhospitable region... Take care of your sanity and be careful not to freeze to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A FRIEND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/1a9a243cf19cd87e8667d1b70aa077019f9eeb2d.jpg"},{"name":" HEATED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/b560931b4655dfa7373108369b51d50fb1cc20ee.jpg"},{"name":"PRAYER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/69abab0802eb06fe0dd1f3286a6a2489f7687dfd.jpg"},{"name":"COLD BLOOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/d1d2db78964c301777f4253d76ac5784fd9ab11c.jpg"},{"name":"PARANOIA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/cf7b71fe5e16452bba54d5da57529c39e04423c5.jpg"},{"name":"END?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/b5cf4388aa8e48fc3464d77aadff709ba514b0f9.jpg"},{"name":"ALL OF US","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/220f307d82e9c85d1733562cd344491e39179af9.jpg"},{"name":"EXPLORER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/3fbe1a15203f68a61f788ec9306fb050723d58af.jpg"},{"name":"VISIONS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/0f044b9d2ceed69e9754f83fa10ec4efbefed3a9.jpg"},{"name":"UVB","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655960/441d0bf01553e9fb5f035e60b05b5b7b4e10cd10.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655960?t=1753938325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655960?t=1753938325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/a42b067ea76c17cd6e9378664f261423f2a0ca2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753938325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/a42b067ea76c17cd6e9378664f261423f2a0ca2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753938325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some trails should remain untouched.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new episode of the <i>Tales Beyond The Tomb</i> series \u2014 colder, more isolated, and more disturbing than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events that were never fully explained, this chapter takes the player to a remote mountain range haunted by wind, ice, and secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a suffocating atmosphere, immersive audio design, and moments of pure psychological horror, this is a journey back to a place that was never meant to be rediscovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Important:</strong> This is a slow-paced walking simulator with a narrative focus. <i>White Silence</i> is about atmosphere, immersion, and discovery at your own pace. It\u2019s for players who enjoy exploring, observing, and piecing the story together through the environment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mute