atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/extras/5499dc6f4e5fe93d7b2eca9ff7286d0c.mp4?t=1753938325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic \u2013</strong> Go back in time with visuals inspired by classic horror films from the 80s and 90s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic Graphics and Immersive Environments -</strong> Feel the terror with realistic visuals and terrifying environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration -\u00a0</strong>Discover tapes, documents, and remnants of the original expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End -\u00a0</strong>An ambiguous, disturbing ending \u2014 just like the case it's inspired by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue Text System \u2013</strong> Immerse yourself in the story with dynamic, narrative dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold and Insanity -</strong> Sometimes the freezing winds of the mountains can cause some disturbances and hallucinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically an immersive first-person walking simulator with an engaging story. Investigate and explore a cold and inhospitable region... Take care of your sanity and be careful not to freeze to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["616 GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655960/756d96bac5c2b9fd636ae6911d993f00c9a62fb8/header.jpg?t=1753938325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul 